=9Cboobs.=E2=80=9D It was hard to maintain my composure but I helped him cl=
ear up the difference in pronunciation for the two words. I also made sure =
to tell him he shouldn=E2=80=99t really have a reason to use the word a lot=
 lol. Also on the drive home I discovered that he has the exact same blueto=
oth car adapter as I do. Same =E2=80=9Cbluetooth pairing=E2=80=9D voice as =
my minivan back at home. Legendary.</span></p><br><p dir=3D"ltr" style=3D"l=
ine-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style=3D"font-size:=
11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transpa=
rent;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-varian=
t-alternates:normal;vertical-align:baseline">Saturday morning we had a Zoom=
 Eikaiwa class with a member of a nearby ward named Aime. I think she is pr=
obably a less active member, and she was referred to us to teach from some =
other elders. It was super fun, and she&#39;s like super good at English. S=
he is finding out which of 7 restaurants she is assigned to at a hotel, and=
 when asked which one she wants to work at, she said the bar, because she w=
ants to learn more about alcohol =F0=9F=92=80 Hopefully we can keep being a=
 positive influence for her!</span></p><br><p dir=3D"ltr" style=3D"line-hei=
ght:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style=3D"font-size:11pt;fo=
nt-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;fo=
nt-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alter=
nates:normal;vertical-align:baseline">This week we also had a big surprise.=
 There is an emergency transfer, and my comp from 2 transfers ago, Mackay=
=E9=95=B7=E8=80=81 is going to be in a trio with me and Magbago=E9=95=B7=E8=
=80=81 for the last 2 weeks of the transfer =F0=9F=98=82=F0=9F=98=82 Can=E2=
=80=99t escape him =F0=9F=98=9C It is Pday as I am typing this and we just =
picked him up today. I am hoping that he can help jumpstart our companionsh=
ip. For the last week most of our day has been spent at the church. I have =
been trying to make the most of the time i.e. writing notes on the back of =
cards to give away to people we house/street and reading from the Book of M=
ormon and the Saints series (still on book 1 lol). I could probably do more=
 to motivate my companion but I have been feeling pretty unenthusiastic abo=
ut it sadly. I regret that I didn=E2=80=99t make us go out and do more thin=
gs. I hope you can tell from this email that things are slowly getting bett=
er though, I think. With a solo Zone leader Mackay=E9=95=B7=E8=80=81 to add=
 to our companionship maybe we can do a better job of holding each other ac=
countable for things. I don=E2=80=99t think that this last week was as much=
 of a waste of time as it has been in the past though, which is really good=
. Focus on the progress!</span></p><br><p dir=3D"ltr" style=3D"line-height:=
1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style=3D"font-size:11pt;font-f=
amily:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-v=
ariant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternate=
s:normal;vertical-align:baseline">Today I have some gospel focused art that=
 I have made that I would love to share! This is the tree of life, spoken a=
bout in 1st Nephi. I have had some meaningful time thinking about what the =
symbols are in these chapters of the Book of Mormon. It was really fun to m=
ake this art, and I hope I can keep the same energy throughout the rest of =
my mission=E2=80=99s art creation.</span></p><p dir=3D"ltr" style=3D"line-h=
eight:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style=3D"font-size:11pt;=
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;=
font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alt=
ernates:normal;vertical-align:baseline"><br></span></p><p dir=3D"ltr" style=
=3D"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style=3D"font-=
