ansparent;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-v=
ariant-alternates:normal;vertical-align:baseline"><br><img src=3D"cid:ii_19=
5ec515e5eb7a0df801" style=3D"max-width: 100%; height: auto;"><br><br></span=
></p><br><p dir=3D"ltr" style=3D"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bot=
tom:0pt"><span style=3D"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:r=
gb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-var=
iant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;vertical-align:baseli=
ne">I love all of you so much. I am not a perfect person, not even a perfec=
t missionary! I know that as I turn to the Lord for strength I will be able=
 to do more than I would be able to on my own, which is a reassurance. I wo=
uld highly encourage each of you to do the same! I wish you the best throug=
hout this next week, I hope that you can wish me the best as well! I will t=
ry to get out more responses and emails to people. It&#39;s tough to balanc=
e the time. This is a special time in my life, and I am probably not gonna =
have a chance to do something quite like this again. I will try and live it=
 to the best of my ability.</span></p></span><br></div></div>

